  "5c5bbe8b-6e25-1f4d-8295-4cec11bf99ab"],
 "\[LineSeparator]calculates the noise sigma based on the tensor \
residual,using a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["blur", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "39ea6369-3893-2c49-ac51-22583e1758cc"],
 " factor of 10. \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"7559e0e9-e7a8-2843-84f2-0d12d6c57ec8"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["SigmaCalc",
