   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["dti", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["tens", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["grad", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["bvec", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["blur", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "6f1e176c-09f6-e542-b34e-ad48761b04f9"],
 "\[LineSeparator]calculates the noise sigma based on the tensor residual. If \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["blur", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a4b22d6c-ea11-954b-a8ce-5a7c217395db"],
 " is 1 there is no blurring."
